<title>FRANCE: HORSE RACING-PRIX DU MOULIN RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-PRIX DU MOULIN RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Prix du Moulin, a</p>
<p>group one race for three-year-olds and upwards, run over one</p>
<p>mile (1.6 km) at Longchamp on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Ashkalani (ridden by Gerald Mosse)</p>
<p>2. Spinning World (Cash Asmussen)</p>
<p>3. Shake The Yoke (Sylvain Guillot)</p>
<p>4. Vetheuil (Olivier Peslier)</p>
<p>Nine ran.</p>
<p>Distances: One and a half lengths, a short head, two</p>
<p>lengths.</p>
<p>Winner owned by the Aga Khan and trained by Alain de</p>
<p>Royer-Dupre in France.</p>
<p>Value to the wining owner: 183,794 dollars.</p>
<p>Pari-Mutuel (to a one franc stake): Win 1.80; places 1.10,</p>
<p>1.10, 1.10. Dual Forecast 2.90.</p>
</text>
